- Hook-handler tests mock internal modules like config, changed-files, agent-tests, scope
- Client tests mock hooks/queries and utils/api
- Tests import mocked modules and use `vi.mocked()` to set return values per test

**Key architectural patterns:**
- Barrel exports (index.ts) in every module
- Services layer: config, log-parser, webhook, orphan-storage, storage, skill-graph, skill-resolver, file-cache, event-bus, keep-awake
- Routes layer: sessions, skills, orphans, events, config, health
- Validator pattern: factory + registry + field validators
